 "profile": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "REACH Digital Signage provides digital signage hardware and content management systems, and is headquartered in Eden Prairie, Minnesota. The software is a cloud-based system that lets businesses create, schedule, manage and deploy content across multiple screens. Uses shown on the homepage include employee communications, digital menu boards, lobby signage, meeting room displays, wayfinding and video walls.",
   "The pages describe the buyers in broad terms, as businesses and organizations across industries, from corporate offices to education, healthcare and retail.",
   "Support, onboarding and troubleshooting are described as part of what is provided. The platform is offered with over 100 free apps and integrations, including news, weather and social media feeds."
  ],
